{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object is seen, move and grab it. Check properties, do task. If not found, scan. list of available nodes: <Action ID = MoveToObject    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <SubTree ID = DoTask    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectInSight    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectWithinReach    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    />",
